python3-tf-keras for Debian
===========================

Packaged under the VitexSoftware Vitexus fork, as a transitive
dependency of opennsfw2 for the invokeai-mastodon project's local
NSFW image classification. opennsfw2 uses tf-keras's legacy Keras 2
API rather than Keras 3.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 15:30:00 +0200
